title: Palo Alto Networks: System information
agents: paloalto_api
catalog: hw/network/paloalto
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-paloalto-api
description:
 Shows model, serial number, PAN-OS version, uptime and content versions
 (applications, threats, antivirus, WildFire, URL filtering) of a Palo Alto
 Networks firewall queried through the PAN-OS XML API by the special agent
 {agent_paloalto_api}. The service is always OK and mainly exists to record
 the uptime and give a quick overview.

discovery:
 One service is created per firewall.
